WEBVTT

00:10:29.051 --> 00:10:31.343
starting with areas
that are most threatened.

00:10:32.226 --> 00:10:34.234
Its purpose is threefold.

00:10:34.717 --> 00:10:40.258
Number one: create a baseline record
of the earth as it exists today

00:10:40.282 --> 00:10:43.105
to more effectively mitigate
the climate crisis.

00:10:43.930 --> 00:10:46.550
To measure change, you need
two sets of data:

00:10:46.574 --> 00:10:48.797
a before and an after.

00:10:49.440 --> 00:10:53.577
Right now, we don't have
a high-resolution before data set

00:10:53.601 --> 00:10:55.489
for much of the planet,

00:10:55.513 --> 00:10:57.454
so we can't measure change,

00:10:57.478 --> 00:11:00.130
and we can't evaluate
which of our current efforts